{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3028524c765b86a2701f18a631b8fb35403bd89ead9330dab03e3b8c2c4bfe51", "ja": "（今日のライブ、みんな本当によくやってくれた……。\nん？　部屋から明かりが漏れてるな。あれは……）", "zh": "（今天的演唱会大家都表现得很棒……\n嗯？房间的灯还开着，那是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_1001_p", "source_sha256": "61bfe2ae8283592e77ba4106905a37977bf4bd527bf9736e6bba270dc6841068", "ja": "春香じゃないか。\nまだ着替えてなかったのか。", "zh": "这不是春香吗？\n你还没换好衣服呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "b8dc83058cb155cbcbc106557a78dc90bce9c7a279d2dd8b01f8aa8295a12ebe", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。お疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c1cd60a2a1b14af4a8817737fdc95dc97344c3b206994b5a521fe839dfbcb192", "ja": "どうしたんだ？　もう他のみんなは\n打ち上げの準備を始めてるぞ。", "zh": "怎么啦？其他人都已经\n在准备庆功宴了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "4db1b296128e8998be8ef30c990f94ba9d2a8e89d64284efa9d7199f077d4803", "ja": "あはは……。ちょっと余韻にひたっちゃってました。\n今回のライブ、すごくよかったので……つい。", "zh": "啊哈哈……我还沉浸在刚才的余韵中。\n这次的演唱会太棒了……我实在忍不住。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c77a552746ce5e758f6c16804c8ee309819c8a9c3d38cfea7f841d6e4b721663", "ja": "ああ、わかるよ。\nそれで、長いこと思いふけっちゃったわけか。", "zh": "确实，我明白你的心情。\n所以你才一直若有所思的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "42ced85255f9f29e9f8ae6654c375d3ad307afa407b2689fd9bad8966aaad7f0", "ja": "はい。あと、ここにいたらなんだか\nいろんなことを思い出しちゃって……。", "zh": "嗯，还有，待在这里，\n感觉会回忆起不少事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_1007_p", "source_sha256": "905b7b5d05893a35751062867a65fe96e668accd0e245353ba66a047820d2090", "ja": "いろんなこと？", "zh": "不少事情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "99dba0d2b2fd829ac0e8c85b8299f4e64bbd0a3fe4d8e09f8bb9030220f455d3", "ja": "今まで私、みんなと、いろんな衣装を着て、\nいろんな歌を歌ってきたんだなぁって……。", "zh": "一直以来，我和大家一起穿了各式各样的服装，\n演唱了许许多多的歌曲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "0dcddd0eb3c9ba84de226e5a2b32e1e51e8aabaf3ef39ee1e4843bcb79f31e5c", "ja": "衣装や、歌の数だけいろんな私がいて、\n自分の知らなかった私にも出会えて……。", "zh": "当中有几套服装、有几首歌，就代表有几个我，\n也因此发现了连自己都不知道的一面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "d9bee5df1eb798faebe37a4d0139982d88496615a3257a5b3e2d4f1ad25fc9da", "ja": "えへへ……。なんだか、どれが本当の私なのか、\nわからなくなっちゃったりして……なーんて。", "zh": "嘿嘿……有这么多个我，感觉都快分不清\n哪个才是真正的自己了……就是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b808a4001bd6b04f2335032696c68bc12019a366779d2980da9a363f9d5a7dd7", "ja": "そうかな？\n本当の春香なら、すぐ分かるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "会吗？\n哪个是真正的春香，一眼就看出来了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "ce463389daeae38fda71903b084321dab65481660c85126e7277f26b6fa257e9", "ja": "え？　それって、どうしてですかっ？\n……わわっ！？", "zh": "咦？为什么你这么肯定？\n……哇哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_1013", "source_sha256": "c80f8f80cff771dcb400a168842318d62facf76f97ebef4aaabf4072bddc5e72", "ja": "おっと！", "zh": "小心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_2000_p", "source_sha256": "c311f67383fdfb2950b1f14a09f74acb392043f2424d8cb643c5b8853fd4d0b9", "ja": "おっと、大丈夫か？　……と、こんな感じで、\nいつでも少し前のめりなのが春香だから。", "zh": "小心，你没事吧？就像这样，\n总是积极又略带冒失，就是春香你的特征。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_2001_001har", "source_sha256": "40b78b1c5173919c7d2de658ba3f4c531aa43c6c0af3f14b6feb0b023e8c7cf7", "ja": "え、えへへ……。\nいつもありがとうございますっ。", "zh": "嘿、嘿嘿……\n谢谢你总是帮我这么多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_2002_p", "source_sha256": "1331cea07449838f37528b716128f4938192d653500cc64ccf3c93a26c9f471a", "ja": "どんな衣装を着て、どんな歌を歌っても、いつでも\nその全部が春香なんだ。見失うことはないよ。", "zh": "不论换上什么服装，演唱什么歌曲，\n那些全都是春香，不会认不出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_2003_001har", "source_sha256": "ea85595522ae7b8f19332da95c65b3805dbb8c7504cd75973d4e23457d79c12b", "ja": "……{$P$}さん。", "zh": "……{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_2004_001har", "source_sha256": "7afa917778883aeece3a7bdb8067e6d0c6db68c49aaf11990ee2bde8ce3bc763", "ja": "あの、私、これからももっといろんな衣装を着て、\nいろんな歌を歌っていきたいです！", "zh": "那个，我今后还想穿更多不一样的服装，\n演唱更多不一样的歌曲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_2005_p", "source_sha256": "6ef2b1a9196a9f06528f2eece2c0a7d91f1d73d6b28e01e823fc7f49f3443aec", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。\nそのために俺がいるんだからな！", "zh": "嗯，这是当然。\n我在这里就是为了帮你实现这些！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0103_2006_001har", "source_sha256": "6a5afeacdc072cefeed07e3d4c2c554b4cb76a10c6f2dadd4ef414dcea3c9657", "ja": "これからもよろしくお願いしますね！\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "今后也请你多多指教了！\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
